      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 14 · AI Data Entry Automation\nConverts unstructured text (emails, forms, notes) into clean structured records and appends them to Google Sheets.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/data-entry` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"text\": \"Hi, this is John smith from Globex, reach me at john.smith@globex.com or 98450 12345. Office: 12 MG Road Bangalore. Meeting on 5th Dec.\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
